{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026W8inZyDP8s1794813542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產啟德新區啟德1號分行經理施蒂文表示，中原最新促成一宗MONACO ONE 2期MONACO MARINE租賃交投，單位為1A座高層H室，實用面積327平方呎，採一房一廁間隔，單位座向北方，擁內園景，現以21000元租出，折合實用呎租64元。<br/>中原地產施蒂文指，該址業主於今年7月才以894萬元購入單位，持貨短短4個月，是次租出單位可即享2.8厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.136938+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:44.891843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:23.016241+00:00","content_hash":"6f48202a3622a82b9972aa4a9bd931b8e85f833d7ac33e3ad41e82144d781e10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}